        "Content": "COMING SOON\r\nThis turnkey home is an ideal choice for first-time buyers or those looking to downsize. The property will be sold fully furnished, including all contents.\r\nConveniently located within a short distance of the vibrant harbour town, the home offers easy access to a wide range of amenities, including two supermarkets, pubs, shops, restaurants, a library, a post office, primary and secondary schools, and a hospital.\r\nAccommodation\r\n•\tGround floor: Open-plan accommodation with a well-equipped kitchen and a combined dining and living area, plus a separate WC.\r\n•\tFirst floor: Two double bedrooms and a shower room with WC.\r\nOutdoor Space\r\nTo the rear is a generously sized garden with a shed.\r\nServices\r\n•\tOil-fired central heating\r\n•\tElectricity\r\n•\tBroadband\r\n\r\nBrochure On Request"
